  FormBox["2", TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "4163b8c7-01db-484b-9750-e697bfa703e1"],
 " and nothing exact there, so the middle-degree condition has no solution. \
The result is a ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    Cell[
     TextData["Failure"]], "paclet:ref/Failure"},
   "RefLink",
   BaseStyle->"InlineFormula"]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "fb1345f7-fb88-4133-a537-b984bdac6cea"],
 " naming the degree:"
}], "ExampleText",ExpressionUUID->"715d2713-2de8-4e04-8622-57e59ff6bed3"],

